<script setup>
import {violationLabels} from '../composables/appealForm.js'
defineProps({items:{type:Array,required:true},preview:{type:Boolean,default:false}})
const outcomes={released:'本次已解除原有效批次',retained:'原批次保留',expired_recorded:'原批次已到期，仅记录重算',released_recorded:'原批次已解除，仅记录重算'}
const previewOutcomes={released:'将解除原有效批次',retained:'将保留原批次',expired_recorded:'原批次已到期，将仅记录重算',released_recorded:'原批次已解除，将仅记录重算'}
const state=value=>({active:'有效',revoked:'已撤销',expired:'已到期',released:'已解除'})[value]||value
</script>
<template><section class="recalculation-summary"><p v-if="!items.length">本次无关联原自动限制批次需要重算。</p><article v-for="item in items" :key="item.restriction_id"><h4>原自动批次#{{item.restriction_id}} · {{(preview?previewOutcomes:outcomes)[item.outcome]||item.outcome}}</h4><p>本次处置前{{state(item.status_before)}} → {{preview?'预计处置后':'处置后'}}{{state(item.status_after)}}；原条件下有效来源{{item.valid_count_before}} → {{item.valid_count_after}}条，阈值{{item.threshold}}条。</p><p>原评估：{{item.evaluated_at}}；原窗口：{{item.window_start}} — {{item.window_end}}；原限制：{{item.starts_at}} — {{item.ends_at}}（Asia/Shanghai）。</p><p v-if="!Array.isArray(item.source_violations)||item.source_violations.length!==3" role="alert">原三条来源数据不完整，请刷新核对；不能补入其他事件。</p><ol><li v-for="source in item.source_violations" :key="source.id"><p>违规#{{source.id}} · {{violationLabels[source.type]||source.type}} · 审核前{{state(source.status)}} → {{preview?'预计审核后':'审核后'}}{{state(source.status_after)}}</p><p>发生{{source.occurred_at}}；登记{{source.registered_at}}</p><p class="reason">公开事实依据：{{source.reason}}</p><p v-if="source.source==='manual'">关联预约涉及他人，不公开编号</p><p v-else-if="source.reservation_id">本人预约#{{source.reservation_id}}</p></li></ol></article><p>仅按原批次、原评估条件和原固定来源重算，不补其他事件；来源消费关联永久保留。已结束预约与使用记录不会恢复。</p></section></template>
<style scoped>.recalculation-summary,.recalculation-summary article{display:grid;gap:9px;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.recalculation-summary article{padding:12px;background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-md)}.recalculation-summary ol{display:grid;gap:8px;padding-left:22px}.reason{white-space:pre-wrap}</style>
